# Route: guide 43 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to 58, 76
# quests, 3.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Dustwallow Marsh, Stranglethorn Vale, Westfall, Darkshore,
# Winterspring, Redridge Mountains): Theramore Isle -> The Quagmire ->
# Theramore Isle -> Brackenwall Village -> Theramore Isle -> The Den of Flame
# -> Theramore Isle -> The Den of Flame -> Theramore Isle -> Booty Bay ->
# Mistvale Valley -> Gurubashi Arena -> Nesingwary's Expedition -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Shadowshard Fragments (7070;
# Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer
# 38); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (735; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun
# the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44); Oh Brother... (167; Foreman
# Thistlenettle 20); Collecting Memories (168; Skeletal Miner 17-18, Undead
# Excavator 17-18, Undead Dynamiter 17-18).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Tiara of the Deep (2846), The Defias Brotherhood (166),
# The Defias Brotherhood (166), The Unsent Letter (373), Drakefire Amulet
# (6502), What Comes Around... (386), What Comes Around... (386), Songblade
# Search (95772), Songblade Search (95772).

